1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,200
When the world began to fail, it did not leave one history behind. It left many.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:09,000
The Archivist was built to preserve places, people, and choices that could no longer survive.

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:15,200
But the records contradicted one another. As power ran out, the Archivist forced them into a single answer.

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:20,000
One archive remained beyond its reach: an old night train carrying the last world seeds offline.

5
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:24,800
Each world remakes the train as it passes.

6
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:28,700
The train does not remember names. It remembers what someone did.
